# Auto-package after changes

When you finish a task that changes product code under `backend/`, `frontend/`, `desktop/`, or root packaging scripts (`package-windows.ps1`, `scripts/stage-backend.ps1`), **always** run packaging before ending the turn:

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File F:\AITEST\package-windows.ps1
```

Use a long block timeout (at least 10 minutes). Report the installer path when done:

- `F:\AITEST\dist\OllamaChat-Setup-1.0.0.exe`
- also under `F:\AITEST\dist\desktop-build\`

## Exceptions (do not package)

- Pure docs / rules / chat-only replies with no product code edits
- User explicitly says not to package
- Packaging already succeeded in the same turn for the same changes

## Notes

- Do not ask whether to package; just run it after substantive product changes.
- If packaging fails, fix the failure and retry once; then report the error.
